# Task #4407: keep the build context lean and reproducible.
# node_modules and the built web/dist are regenerated in the Node build stage —
# never ship the host's copies (64M node_modules would bloat the image; a stale
# web/dist would defeat the from-source build).
**/node_modules
management/web/dist

# Python / VCS / editor noise that never belongs in the image.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.git
.gitignore
**/.DS_Store
**/*.egg-info
.pytest_cache
